VALUES ('bp-voltar-e-poupar', 1, 'bp-voltar-e-poupar', 'Voltar é poupar (edição 18 mai – 30 jun 2026)', 'Historical BP voucher campaign: €3 on a 25 L bp Ultimate fill or €1 on a Regular fill, used on the following fill.', NULL, NULL, 0, 'campaign', 'BP', '[]', '["BP"]', '["BP"]', '[]', 0, 'coupon', NULL, NULL, 'sum', NULL, NULL, 'always', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, '2026-05-18', '2026-06-30', 'medium', 'https://www.bp.com/pt_pt/portugal/home/campanhas/na-bp--voltar-e-poupar.html', '2026-10-23', NULL, 'manual', 'Historical edition of a campaign BP re-runs periodically, retained deliberately as an expiry fixture: it must derive status "expired" and never affect a price. Fuel-grade-specific vouchers (bp Ultimate) cannot be mapped to DGEG fuel types, so campaigns of this shape are catalogued but not applied. bp.com blocks automated fetches (403), hence manual mode.', '2026-10-23')
